WEBVTT

00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:04.220
No matter how pointless it seems,

00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:06.880
there are some things you have to do!

00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:08.950
Do... Do... Do...

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:15.490
Like holding student council
when it's just the two of us?

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:16.110
Yeah.

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:18.800
This room's pretty big, isn't it?

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:20.170
Yeah.

00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:23.750
By now, Mafuyu-chan and Chizuru-san must be...

00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:26.000
It's gotten cold.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:26.910
Yeah.

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:31.180
It's kind of strange for
us to be alone together.

00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:35.280
That doesn't happen unless
we're shopping for supplies.

00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:36.860
Yeah.

00:00:38.530 --> 00:00:40.590
They'll come back when
they're done shopping.

00:00:40.990 --> 00:00:42.690
What's Minatsu doing?

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:45.560
Hmm, I don't know.

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:47.470
Help the lacrosse team, huh?

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:49.100
Please, Minatsu.

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:51.200
We can't lose this next game.

00:00:52.810 --> 00:00:54.940
Okay, I'll think about it.

00:00:55.170 --> 00:00:56.400
Thanks!

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:57.760
We're counting on you.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:01.060
Okay, time for me to get
back to the student council.

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:01.860
Minatsu!

00:01:04.850 --> 00:01:05.950
Meguru!

00:01:07.310 --> 00:01:09.960
It's unusual for so many
people to miss a meeting.

00:01:10.220 --> 00:01:13.070
People skip out for various
reasons every so often,

00:01:13.070 --> 00:01:15.520
but this has never happened before.

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:16.660
Yeah.

00:02:59.890 --> 00:03:01.330
S-So, Sugisaki.

00:03:01.330 --> 00:03:03.440
What should we talk about today?

00:03:04.190 --> 00:03:06.660
You don't have a topic ready?

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:07.870
Nope.

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:11.730
The two of us can't decide by ourselves.

00:03:11.730 --> 00:03:13.950
We're missing over half the group.

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:16.980
That's true, but...

00:03:17.220 --> 00:03:19.320
What are we doing here?

00:03:19.320 --> 00:03:21.240
I'm asking you.

00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:22.690
You're leaving it to me?

00:03:22.930 --> 00:03:23.550
Yeah.

00:03:23.890 --> 00:03:26.600
We should let you take
the lead, sometimes.

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:28.690
Only at times like these...

00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:33.170
Since we're alone, why don't we
talk about our love for each other?

00:03:34.050 --> 00:03:36.340
We're done for today!

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:39.420
You hate my idea so much,

00:03:39.420 --> 00:03:41.850
you brought back a weird
gimmick from first season?

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:44.710
I'll think of a real topic,

00:03:44.710 --> 00:03:48.480
so don't take away the one thing
I look forward to each day.

00:03:50.020 --> 00:03:52.550
Fine, if you insist.

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:58.620
Is that an alarm?

00:03:58.620 --> 00:04:00.460
I'm trusting you, Sugisaki.

00:04:01.280 --> 00:04:03.470
Do you have that little faith in me?

00:04:04.080 --> 00:04:07.200
So let's think of something
just the two of us can do.

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:10.070
The two of us... Something naughty!

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:12.980
You pressed the button!

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:14.670
You didn't even hesitate
before pressing it!

00:04:15.510 --> 00:04:17.360
I didn't expect it to be so loud!

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:19.910
Sugisaki, how do you stop this thing?

00:04:19.910 --> 00:04:23.020
Jeez, think before you act.

00:04:23.870 --> 00:04:25.410
How do you stop it?

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:26.700
Stop it now!

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:28.220
Quickly!

00:04:28.540 --> 00:04:30.050
What else do we need...

00:04:30.630 --> 00:04:33.180
Can you look at the shopping
list, Mafuyu-chan?

00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:34.810
Mafuyu-chan?

00:04:40.370 --> 00:04:41.620
Akaba-senpai?

00:04:41.620 --> 00:04:43.600
"Secret Tales of
Warring States Heroes"?

00:04:44.010 --> 00:04:45.190
That's surprising.

00:04:45.190 --> 00:04:47.040
I thought you only read BL.

00:04:47.360 --> 00:04:50.210
Lately, I've been big
into historical stuff.

00:04:50.210 --> 00:04:52.040
I was fantasizing about them.

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:53.280
Fantasizing?

00:04:53.280 --> 00:04:54.640
I was pairing them up and deciding

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:56.620
who'd top and who'd bottom.

00:04:56.830 --> 00:05:00.770
Like Date Masamune and Katakura Kojuro.

00:05:01.390 --> 00:05:02.890
I can understand that.

00:05:03.630 --> 00:05:05.560
You can?

00:05:05.910 --> 00:05:06.890
Yeah, it's easy.

00:05:07.170 --> 00:05:09.070
Masamune and Kojuro, yeah?

00:05:09.070 --> 00:05:11.900
Masamune is the S and
Kojuro is the M, right?

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:16.130
S and M and top and
bottom are different.

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:21.910
It stopped.

00:05:21.910 --> 00:05:23.140
Good.

00:05:23.140 --> 00:05:26.140
Okay, don't press it again.

00:05:26.140 --> 00:05:27.190
Yeah.

00:05:27.190 --> 00:05:29.650
It's not okay to use
for jokes, I guess.

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:33.260
But it's weird that nobody came to see

00:05:33.260 --> 00:05:36.350
what was up with that loud noise.

00:05:36.860 --> 00:05:40.830
They probably thought,
"Oh, it's just the student council again!"

00:05:41.240 --> 00:05:43.660
What are we, exactly?

00:05:47.020 --> 00:05:50.950
Now then, what can the
two of us do together?

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:53.670
Maybe something for two people alone?

00:05:53.860 --> 00:05:55.670
Then definitely something naughty!

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:04.180
Do you have anything
to say to me, Sugisaki?

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:05.350
I love you.

00:06:05.350 --> 00:06:08.820
What? That's the worst possible
time for a love confession!

00:06:09.170 --> 00:06:10.860
Not like that...

00:06:10.860 --> 00:06:14.130
Apologize for sexually
harassing me again!

00:06:15.210 --> 00:06:18.210
I'm terribly sorry.

00:06:18.210 --> 00:06:20.370
F-Fine, get your head off the floor!

00:06:21.420 --> 00:06:22.630
Thank you.

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:27.720
Anyway, something we can do
when it's just the two of us.

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:30.680
The two of us can use the
whole student council room.

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:33.230
It is pretty big.

00:06:33.230 --> 00:06:37.070
We'll pretend this desk is a bed, and...

00:06:39.150 --> 00:06:40.470
I'm sorry.

00:06:40.470 --> 00:06:42.520
Put the alarm away, please.

00:06:43.320 --> 00:06:45.590
I see, you're off today.

00:06:45.590 --> 00:06:47.890
That's why you're here,
even though school's over.

00:06:47.890 --> 00:06:51.880
Yeah, I wanted to
chat with you a little.

00:06:51.880 --> 00:06:53.020
Oshino-senpai!

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:57.170
We've always been fans
of Hoshino Meguru!

00:06:57.170 --> 00:06:59.400
Can we get a picture?

00:06:59.400 --> 00:07:01.910
The idol Hoshino Meguru is off today.

00:07:02.490 --> 00:07:05.270
Right now, I'm Uchuu Meguru,
from class 2-B of Hekiyou Academy.

00:07:05.560 --> 00:07:06.200
Bye.

00:07:09.910 --> 00:07:12.160
You need to take better
care of your fans.

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:15.350
I can't work when I'm off.

00:07:16.130 --> 00:07:18.890
You should fix that
personality of yours.

00:07:19.690 --> 00:07:21.620
So what did you want to talk about?

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:24.200
I need to get to the student council.

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:28.200
Student council, huh?

00:07:29.180 --> 00:07:29.940
Meguru?

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:32.850
What's Sugisaki like there?

00:07:33.610 --> 00:07:35.620
Sugisaki, you know?

00:07:35.950 --> 00:07:40.300
What's he like
during student council?

00:07:40.300 --> 00:07:42.580
What's he like?

00:07:42.580 --> 00:07:44.450
He just sexually harasses us.

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:45.510
I see.

00:07:45.510 --> 00:07:46.720
I'm jealous.

00:07:47.010 --> 00:07:48.040
Of what?

00:07:48.920 --> 00:07:52.220
I-It's not that I like Sugisaki!

00:07:52.220 --> 00:07:55.050
I was just wondering.

00:07:56.500 --> 00:07:59.790
Um, Meguru, I need to go...

00:08:00.380 --> 00:08:05.210
If you really insist on telling me what
Sugisaki's like at student council,

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:06.940
I wouldn't mind listening.

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:09.450
Let's take a taxi somewhere.

00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:11.900
Can I get a taxi?

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:13.900
Yes, at the gate.

00:08:14.350 --> 00:08:18.480
Don't worry, I stole plenty of taxi
tickets from the office.

00:08:18.480 --> 00:08:20.460
No, that's not the issue...

00:08:20.460 --> 00:08:21.860
Let's go.

00:08:21.860 --> 00:08:23.990
But I've got student council.

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:29.730
It's kind of unnerving
to take away the desk.

00:08:29.730 --> 00:08:31.000
Yeah.

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:34.440
It's like a wall
has disappeared.

00:08:35.600 --> 00:08:37.770
Sugisaki, don't look at my skirt!

00:08:39.010 --> 00:08:40.770
I-I'm sorry.

00:08:41.220 --> 00:08:42.740
I really didn't mean to.

00:08:43.310 --> 00:08:46.260
It's not usually like this, so...

00:08:46.260 --> 00:08:47.280
So what?

00:08:47.760 --> 00:08:51.520
It's like a meeting for an arranged marriage!

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:54.290
I wouldn't go to an arranged
marriage meeting with you!

00:08:54.460 --> 00:08:55.930
That's right.

00:08:57.930 --> 00:08:58.870
What are your hobbies?

00:08:58.870 --> 00:08:59.660
<i>Is</i> this a meeting?

00:09:01.510 --> 00:09:03.030
My hobbies are H-games.

00:09:03.210 --> 00:09:05.140
What do we do next?

00:09:05.140 --> 00:09:06.720
Our arranged marriage meeting is over?

00:09:06.720 --> 00:09:08.000
After one line?!

00:09:08.390 --> 00:09:09.870
If we're just talking,

00:09:09.870 --> 00:09:11.770
there was no point in moving the desk.

00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:14.060
But...

00:09:14.060 --> 00:09:17.140
What can the two of
us do in a big room...

00:09:17.900 --> 00:09:21.030
Senpai, this is the book
you were looking for, right?

00:09:21.030 --> 00:09:22.480
It is!

00:09:22.710 --> 00:09:23.410
Thank you.

00:09:27.980 --> 00:09:29.560
That's easy, right?

00:09:29.560 --> 00:09:32.020
The senpai is the top and
the junior is the bottom.

00:09:32.490 --> 00:09:35.010
That's one potential interpretation.

00:09:35.730 --> 00:09:36.730
Then what about them?

00:09:37.160 --> 00:09:38.840
The clerk and the salesman?

00:09:38.840 --> 00:09:40.430
Please.

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:41.230
No way.

00:09:41.580 --> 00:09:42.450
Yes.

00:09:42.450 --> 00:09:45.240
Guys in suits are my favorite, lately.

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:47.240
That's easy, too.

00:09:47.610 --> 00:09:50.240
The clerk is the top and
the salesman is the bottom.

00:09:50.240 --> 00:09:50.800
Right?

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:55.650
It might appear that way at first glance,
but Mafuyu thinks it's the opposite.

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:56.640
Really?

00:09:56.640 --> 00:09:59.050
The world of BL is deep!

00:09:59.670 --> 00:10:00.690
Okay!

00:10:01.390 --> 00:10:06.160
Mafuyu will teach you everything
there is to know about BL!

00:10:07.070 --> 00:10:07.930
Here I go!

00:10:07.930 --> 00:10:09.760
Ultimate Technique: Invisible Curveball!

00:10:09.760 --> 00:10:11.200
Crazy!

00:10:12.310 --> 00:10:13.640
Nice control.

00:10:15.020 --> 00:10:17.610
I may not look it, but my dad told me

00:10:17.610 --> 00:10:21.370
I'd grow up to play in the major leagues.

00:10:21.810 --> 00:10:23.880
With your typical girl's throw?

00:10:24.130 --> 00:10:26.580
Your dad's so nice it's
kind of irritating.

00:10:26.580 --> 00:10:27.420
Oh no!

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:35.250
Catch the ball!

00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:36.400
You're supposed to catch it?

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:38.120
That never occurred to me.

00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:39.220
It didn't?

00:10:39.530 --> 00:10:42.230
And this is a little
too straightforward.

00:10:42.640 --> 00:10:45.460
Well then, let's add words.

00:10:45.890 --> 00:10:48.610
When you throw the ball,
state an opinion or a question,

00:10:48.610 --> 00:10:50.480
and the catcher will answer it.

00:10:50.480 --> 00:10:51.970
That sounds fun.

00:10:52.400 --> 00:10:54.450
I've got my meeting to go to!

00:10:56.390 --> 00:10:59.740
I'll listen to everything you
have to say about Sugisaki.

00:11:00.370 --> 00:11:01.800
My meeting...

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:04.010
Here I go!

00:11:04.010 --> 00:11:05.380
Die!

00:11:06.750 --> 00:11:07.950
I don't want to.

00:11:07.950 --> 00:11:09.860
And this isn't catch.

00:11:09.860 --> 00:11:11.620
This is not what you call catch.

00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:14.410
I gave an opinion, though.

00:11:14.410 --> 00:11:18.210
I gave you my honest opinion,
and you reacted to it.

00:11:18.630 --> 00:11:20.130
It's wonderful, isn't it?

00:11:20.420 --> 00:11:21.900
In a general sense, maybe.

00:11:22.140 --> 00:11:25.580
Anyway, no more death, okay?

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:27.770
Fine.

00:11:27.770 --> 00:11:29.340
Then it's your turn.

00:11:30.420 --> 00:11:31.870
Okay, marry me!

00:11:31.870 --> 00:11:32.840
No!

00:11:33.470 --> 00:11:36.420
No, no, at least catch the ball.

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:40.150
I can't catch the ball when
it's got strings like that attached!

00:11:41.370 --> 00:11:42.650
Date me.

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:43.420
No.

00:11:44.540 --> 00:11:45.910
I love you.

00:11:45.910 --> 00:11:47.370
I know and I don't like it.

00:11:47.370 --> 00:11:48.620
I won't cheat.

00:11:48.620 --> 00:11:50.080
I don't believe you!

00:11:50.080 --> 00:11:51.430
I'm serious about all of you!

00:11:51.430 --> 00:11:52.800
That makes it even worse!

00:11:53.110 --> 00:11:56.470
Then are you okay saying goodbye to me?

00:12:03.850 --> 00:12:04.640
President?

00:12:20.030 --> 00:12:22.820
Please play with me forever.

00:12:25.360 --> 00:12:31.060
Let's play... forever... all of us.

00:12:32.190 --> 00:12:33.060
President.

00:12:37.240 --> 00:12:38.880
We're back.

00:12:39.740 --> 00:12:41.520
Why did you move the desk?

00:12:41.920 --> 00:12:44.350
Just so we could play catch.

00:12:44.350 --> 00:12:45.770
Right, Sugisaki?

00:12:45.770 --> 00:12:46.700
That's right.

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:47.890
It was fun.

00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:50.110
You guys are acting kind of weird.

00:12:50.110 --> 00:12:51.120
Yeah.

00:12:51.350 --> 00:12:53.310
Anyway, why were you late?

00:12:53.310 --> 00:12:55.170
Well...

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:56.920
The time flew by.

00:12:58.110 --> 00:12:59.130
That took forever.

00:12:59.440 --> 00:13:01.630
Are you okay? What happened?

00:13:01.630 --> 00:13:03.850
Nothing...

00:13:04.700 --> 00:13:06.550
Everybody's acting weird.

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:08.000
What's going on?

00:13:08.000 --> 00:13:09.450
I don't know.

00:13:09.450 --> 00:13:12.140
But it feels more relaxed
when everyone's here.

00:13:13.230 --> 00:13:13.910
Yeah.

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:36.730
How long have I been staring
at this install screen?

00:13:36.730 --> 00:13:38.340
Damn it! How?

00:13:38.600 --> 00:13:42.190
How could I lose the serial
code to my favorite game?

00:13:42.190 --> 00:13:43.840
I'm so stupid!

00:13:46.280 --> 00:13:48.600
If I remember right,
after I played this game,

00:13:48.600 --> 00:13:52.930
I inherited my dad's old computer
and moved everything onto it.

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:57.860
But if I want to play this game on
my new PC, I need to reinstall it.

00:13:58.000 --> 00:13:59.020
Damn it!

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:01.130
The serial code!

00:14:01.810 --> 00:14:04.200
I can't believe I'd throw it away.

00:14:04.740 --> 00:14:08.280
Then it must somewhere in this room.

00:14:10.840 --> 00:14:15.050
What was I thinking when I bought
this medal with my name on it?

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:21.870
I need to eat healthier food.

00:14:25.350 --> 00:14:27.860
This is <i>so</i>... not what I'm into.

00:14:31.290 --> 00:14:33.460
I don't remember buying this.

00:14:33.460 --> 00:14:35.470
I've never worn it.

00:14:37.510 --> 00:14:38.940
I can't find it.

00:14:39.860 --> 00:14:40.720
Damn it!

00:14:40.720 --> 00:14:42.050
This isn't right!

00:14:42.050 --> 00:14:42.850
Think!

00:14:42.850 --> 00:14:44.240
Why isn't it here?

00:14:44.240 --> 00:14:46.620
I never threw it away! So why?

00:14:48.010 --> 00:14:49.300
It's at my parent's place?

00:14:58.090 --> 00:14:58.960
Yes?

00:14:58.960 --> 00:15:00.300
Hello?

00:15:00.730 --> 00:15:02.650
This is Sugisaki Ringo.

00:15:03.020 --> 00:15:04.370
Age 16.

00:15:04.370 --> 00:15:05.440
Ringo!

00:15:05.440 --> 00:15:06.260
It's me! Me!

00:15:07.310 --> 00:15:10.210
Ringo doesn't have much money...

00:15:10.210 --> 00:15:11.370
I'm sorry.

00:15:11.370 --> 00:15:13.080
I'm not trying to scam you out of money!

00:15:13.840 --> 00:15:14.770
Brother?

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:16.550
That's right. It's your brother.

00:15:16.550 --> 00:15:18.350
Your beloved brother.

00:15:18.350 --> 00:15:19.580
Hooray!

00:15:20.450 --> 00:15:21.880
Don't go back to bed, Ringo!

00:15:21.880 --> 00:15:23.490
Sorry to bother you when you're asleep,

00:15:23.490 --> 00:15:26.040
but could you do something
for your brother?

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:27.390
Sure!

00:15:27.390 --> 00:15:30.790
I'd do anything... for... you...

00:15:32.370 --> 00:15:34.050
Wake up! Snap out of it!

00:15:34.050 --> 00:15:34.790
Snap.

00:15:35.600 --> 00:15:38.030
You're not snapped out of anything.

00:15:38.030 --> 00:15:38.980
Anyway.

00:15:38.980 --> 00:15:40.790
I want you to check something for me.

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:42.620
Will you go to the storeroom?

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:44.560
It's cold.

00:15:45.010 --> 00:15:47.670
Didn't you just say you'd do anything?

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:50.070
Except get out of bed.

00:15:50.070 --> 00:15:51.300
You can't do anything, then!

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:53.210
How weak willed are you?

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:56.380
Is it that important?

00:15:56.380 --> 00:16:01.260
So important that Ringo has to
get out of her warm blankets?

00:16:02.950 --> 00:16:04.580
Yeah, I guess.

00:16:04.920 --> 00:16:06.610
Oh, fine.

00:16:06.610 --> 00:16:09.590
I'll do my best for you, brother.

00:16:09.880 --> 00:16:11.080
It's so cold!

00:16:11.080 --> 00:16:12.460
You can do it, Ringo.

00:16:17.980 --> 00:16:19.210
I'm here.

00:16:19.210 --> 00:16:20.470
What do I do?

00:16:20.900 --> 00:16:22.900
I want you to look for an old PC.

00:16:23.930 --> 00:16:25.410
I see it.

00:16:25.410 --> 00:16:27.440
Is there a manual near it?

00:16:27.440 --> 00:16:28.950
A manual?

00:16:28.950 --> 00:16:30.210
Hmm...

00:16:30.760 --> 00:16:34.590
There's a lot of papers
crammed in here.

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:37.220
Is there anything that looks
like a postcard with numbers on it?

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:38.680
Hold on.

00:16:39.160 --> 00:16:40.570
I see it.

00:16:40.570 --> 00:16:43.990
It says "Win***" and "I*M" on it.

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:45.790
Is that all?

00:16:45.790 --> 00:16:47.490
Oh no, was I wrong?

00:16:47.490 --> 00:16:53.230
Oh, and I don't think this is it,
but there's one with cute girls on it.

00:16:54.000 --> 00:16:55.560
That's it!

00:16:56.250 --> 00:16:58.000
Hey, shut up!

00:16:58.210 --> 00:17:00.080
Y-You scared me!

00:17:00.080 --> 00:17:02.240
Why are you yelling?

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:04.890
I was just really happy.

00:17:05.410 --> 00:17:06.270
Now, Ringo.

00:17:06.710 --> 00:17:08.410
There's a number, right?

00:17:08.410 --> 00:17:09.070
Yeah.

00:17:09.070 --> 00:17:11.540
Um, the serial code?

00:17:11.540 --> 00:17:12.690
Yes.

00:17:12.690 --> 00:17:14.050
Can you read that to me?

00:17:14.750 --> 00:17:18.170
Okay, but what number is this?

00:17:18.170 --> 00:17:19.720
Oh, you know.

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:21.690
No, I don't!

00:17:21.690 --> 00:17:23.350
W-Well...

00:17:23.350 --> 00:17:24.210
Um...

00:17:24.210 --> 00:17:26.200
It's a nuclear launch code!

00:17:27.090 --> 00:17:28.610
Then I won't tell you!

00:17:28.610 --> 00:17:30.070
Definitely not!

00:17:30.280 --> 00:17:31.510
I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

00:17:31.510 --> 00:17:33.630
That was a joke. A joke.

00:17:33.630 --> 00:17:34.800
So what is this?

00:17:34.800 --> 00:17:36.340
Well, it's...

00:17:36.740 --> 00:17:37.840
Well?

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:43.400
Listen to me, Ringo.

00:17:43.840 --> 00:17:47.590
That's the code I need to
start up my favorite h-game...

00:17:48.670 --> 00:17:49.590
She hung up.

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:51.940
Stupid brother.

00:17:54.510 --> 00:17:55.950
Hello, Ringo?

00:17:55.950 --> 00:17:58.720
I'm busy warming up the shredder.

00:17:58.720 --> 00:17:59.690
Wait, wait, wait!

00:17:59.690 --> 00:18:01.320
Wait, little sister!

00:18:01.320 --> 00:18:02.870
Shred shred shred!

00:18:03.030 --> 00:18:07.110
Um, well... Ringo-san,
why are you upset?

00:18:07.350 --> 00:18:10.610
'Cause you said you play dirty games.

00:18:10.610 --> 00:18:11.980
Um, well...

00:18:11.980 --> 00:18:15.110
Is that jealousy?

00:18:15.440 --> 00:18:18.620
My body's not good enough for you?

00:18:19.880 --> 00:18:22.090
Do you know what you're saying?

00:18:22.380 --> 00:18:24.240
Asuka-oneechan once told me,

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:29.770
"If you ever see Ken reading a
dirty book, that's what you say."

00:18:29.770 --> 00:18:32.100
That Asuka...

00:18:33.290 --> 00:18:34.830
Oh, it's Mom.

00:18:35.620 --> 00:18:38.070
No!

00:18:39.900 --> 00:18:42.840
Why were you hiding
behind the door, Mom?

00:18:43.650 --> 00:18:45.800
She ran off looking really pale.

00:18:45.800 --> 00:18:46.480
Crap.

00:18:47.130 --> 00:18:52.140
My step-mother thinks her daughter
and I are in a relationship!

00:18:52.630 --> 00:18:54.990
The Sugisaki family is in danger.

00:18:55.300 --> 00:18:57.320
Anyway, no dirty stuff!

00:18:57.640 --> 00:19:00.990
You don't have to look
at that stuff, I think.

00:19:01.230 --> 00:19:05.760
Um, Ringo-san... Guys
don't work that way.

00:19:06.240 --> 00:19:09.990
All guys think about dirty stuff.

00:19:09.990 --> 00:19:14.090
Then you can just think
dirty stuff about me!

00:19:14.540 --> 00:19:16.140
Oh, Dad!

00:19:21.230 --> 00:19:23.480
Dad, are you crying?

00:19:23.480 --> 00:19:25.130
Are you crying?

00:19:25.730 --> 00:19:26.500
He's gone.

00:19:26.500 --> 00:19:29.390
Thus ends the Sugisaki family.

00:19:29.720 --> 00:19:33.830
Anyway, big brother,
no dirty games or books.

00:19:34.110 --> 00:19:35.120
Are you the devil?

00:19:35.120 --> 00:19:37.280
And all guys do it!

00:19:37.280 --> 00:19:38.440
It's a fundamental need!

00:19:38.440 --> 00:19:40.380
A fundamental desire.

00:19:41.210 --> 00:19:42.450
You're right.

00:19:42.450 --> 00:19:45.580
I didn't understand that about guys.

00:19:45.900 --> 00:19:47.040
I'm sorry.

00:19:47.420 --> 00:19:48.900
Okay then...

00:19:48.900 --> 00:19:50.910
You'll give me the serial code?

00:19:51.110 --> 00:19:51.990
I'll...

00:19:52.800 --> 00:19:55.180
I'll send you dirty pictures of myself!

00:19:55.810 --> 00:19:58.220
A real H-game! Awesome!

00:19:58.220 --> 00:19:59.960
Wait, that's not good.

00:19:59.960 --> 00:20:02.200
Wait, don't do that!

00:20:04.780 --> 00:20:05.910
Crap!

00:20:05.910 --> 00:20:08.670
Ringo's really going
to send me a dirty picture?

00:20:08.670 --> 00:20:11.430
I'm happy... I'm really
happy, but as a person,

00:20:11.430 --> 00:20:13.760
and as an older brother,
I have to stop her!

00:20:15.630 --> 00:20:16.850
Here it is!

00:20:18.550 --> 00:20:20.440
Oh no! I can't stop my fingers!

00:20:20.440 --> 00:20:21.710
Dirty Pictures
From Sugisaki Ringo

00:20:21.710 --> 00:20:22.940
Downloading Attachment

00:20:22.940 --> 00:20:24.900
I'm sorry, sister.

00:20:24.900 --> 00:20:25.810
But...

00:20:26.840 --> 00:20:28.450
But your brother...!

00:20:32.330 --> 00:20:35.050
That's pretty high level stuff.

00:20:37.980 --> 00:20:38.960
Hello?

00:20:39.240 --> 00:20:41.140
Well, brother?

00:20:41.140 --> 00:20:45.230
I was really embarrassed,
but I did my best.

00:20:45.620 --> 00:20:47.350
Oh, yeah.

00:20:48.060 --> 00:20:49.320
I bet you did.

00:20:49.860 --> 00:20:51.530
I bet you did, but...

00:20:51.980 --> 00:20:54.470
That night, I realized something else.

00:20:55.110 --> 00:20:57.860
There was a vast gulf between my

00:20:57.860 --> 00:21:00.550
understanding of "dirty," and Ringo's.

00:21:01.900 --> 00:21:03.750
Brother, are you listening?

00:21:05.420 --> 00:21:08.930
I was moved by your sexy shot.

00:21:09.270 --> 00:21:12.240
Yours is a level of sexiness
no one else will ever attain.

00:21:12.240 --> 00:21:14.860
So... So...

00:21:15.390 --> 00:21:18.680
Please tell me the
serial code, little sister!

00:21:21.250 --> 00:21:23.500
I got it! I finally got it!

00:21:23.500 --> 00:21:24.770
I can finally see it!

00:21:32.030 --> 00:21:33.030
This is strange.

00:21:33.820 --> 00:21:34.780
There's no H.

00:21:38.290 --> 00:21:40.840
All ages version?

00:21:41.410 --> 00:21:42.260
I'm...

00:21:43.500 --> 00:21:47.530
I'm... right back where I started!

00:23:24.040 --> 00:23:26.150
You look tired, Key-kun.

00:23:26.150 --> 00:23:28.090
Yesterday was pretty rough.

00:23:28.360 --> 00:23:31.100
I got muscle aches.

00:23:31.330 --> 00:23:34.970
Did the two of you have a student
council meeting yesterday?

00:23:35.350 --> 00:23:37.530
I wanted to hear about that, too.

00:23:37.530 --> 00:23:39.740
What did the two of you do?

00:23:40.040 --> 00:23:43.480
We played catch, arranged our marriage...

00:23:43.770 --> 00:23:44.740
Marriage?

00:23:44.740 --> 00:23:46.800
And I told you how much I love you.

00:23:46.800 --> 00:23:47.980
You did, yeah.

00:23:48.230 --> 00:23:49.750
Lo-Love?

00:23:49.750 --> 00:23:51.810
What was that, senpai?

00:23:51.810 --> 00:23:55.250
This is a huge deal!

00:23:55.630 --> 00:23:58.500
Oh, and the President said she
wants to be with me forever.

00:23:58.500 --> 00:24:00.260
Yeah, I did.

00:24:00.910 --> 00:24:02.980
How'd you two suddenly get so close?

00:24:02.980 --> 00:24:04.500
What happened yesterday?

00:24:04.950 --> 00:24:06.640
Nothing, really.

00:24:06.640 --> 00:24:09.960
Oh, and I hit the alarm a bunch.

00:24:09.960 --> 00:24:11.310
Yeah, you did.

00:24:11.310 --> 00:24:12.500
That was fun, wasn't it?

00:24:12.500 --> 00:24:13.820
Fun?

00:24:13.820 --> 00:24:15.270
What happened?

00:24:17.280 --> 00:24:18.510
Shut up!

00:24:18.510 --> 00:24:20.780
Forget it and let's start our meeting.

00:24:20.780 --> 00:24:22.070
Start it?

00:24:25.150 --> 00:24:26.790
One day, something awful happened.

00:24:26.790 --> 00:24:28.560
My sister's hurt!

00:24:28.560 --> 00:24:30.480
A time of terror, and screaming won't help you.

00:24:30.480 --> 00:24:33.340
If you're going to kill my brother, kill me first!

00:24:33.340 --> 00:24:35.360
Next time: The Student Council Welcomes

00:24:35.360 --> 00:24:36.960
Terror is waiting for you.

00:24:36.960 --> 00:24:38.500
That's really scary!
